Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat(builder): a node built from a given chain state

WalletBuilder::chain_state() starts the node from a given chain state,
such as a snapshot of headers the caller already holds and checked,
instead of the sync policy's checkpoint, so it downloads none of them
again.
